1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:03,580
(Sheldon:)And also, it's really scary.

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:06,720
(Leonard:)Would someone please turn off
the Sheldon commentary track?

3
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:10,650
(Sheldon:)There's no switch.
Just listen and learn.

4
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:13,060
(Howard:)Penny, if you think
this is good,

5
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,260
(Howard:)you should come with us Friday

6
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,390
(Howard:)to see it on the big screen
at the Colonial.

7
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,460
(Penny:)Well, I'm watching it now.

8
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:18,960
(Penny:)Why would I want to see it again
on Friday?

9
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:20,900
(Sheldon:)Because the print
they're showing on Friday

10
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:25,190
(Sheldon:)has an additional 21 seconds
of previously unseen footage.

11
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:29,870
(Penny:)21 seconds? That'll be like
seeing a whole new movie!

12
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:31,110
(Leonard:)Exactly.

13
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:32,940
(Leonard:)They say it finally solves
the submarine controversy.

14
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,980
(Sheldon:)Did-- Leonard?

15
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:36,580
(Sheldon:)I'm no expert, but I believe

16
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,500
(Sheldon:)what we just heard from Penny
was sarcasm.

17
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:41,750
Oh! Good.

18
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:43,420
(Sheldon:)I'm eight for 26 this month.

19
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:46,060
(Penny:)Yeah, I think I'll pass.

20
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:48,930
(Penny:)But you guys enjoy
your extra 21 seconds.

21
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:50,390
(Leonard:)Bet if I could
make you understand

22
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:52,730
(Leonard:)why this is such a cool thing,
we'd still be together.

23
00:00:52,730 --> 00:00:56,230
(Penny:)Mm, yeah, no,
we wouldn't.

24
00:00:56,230 --> 00:00:57,640
(Howard:)Uh-huh.

25
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:01,740
(Howard:)I'm guessing 21 seconds had
something to do with that, too.

26
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:09,200
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

